# save: 24-Museum
# Summers hospital: revive an unconscious Paula (Yes, pay, the healing sfx, the prompts), then the
# last prompt closes the pause menu and the wandering npc1048 picks its next move
# The emu's setup `wait` counts wall frames, and the teleport's load lags the original by one, so the
# port waits 9 to start the body with npc1048's pause timer in the same phase (with 10 its roll after
# the menu closes comes a frame early in the port)
flag 11 1; status 2 1 1; teleport 6735 9680 0
port: wait 9
emu: wait 10
until idle 300
---
press A; wait 30; press A; wait 200; press RIGHT; wait 10; press A; wait 200; press A; wait 200; press A; wait 200
press A; wait 200; press A; wait 200; press A; wait 200; press A; wait 200; press A; wait 300
